[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_6jkg2")
dialogue_id = "debate_twin_gods"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Twin Gods"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: The Explorer has brought us curious sermons from an isolated shard, penned by survivors who worshipped the sun and the moon.
scribe: Left adrift after the Shattering, they sought comfort in the celestial bodies above them.
scribe: We cannot fault them, for a heart desperate for warmth will gather what embers it can find.
scribe: Their devotion, though genuine, illuminates the profound tragedy of our long silence.
scribe: They yearned for the Enlightened One, yet we withheld the teachings to ourselves, leaving these souls to grasp at fragments of the divine.
scribe: By failing to share the unified truth, we abandoned generations to wander the dark alone.
scribe: We hold the lantern that can guide them home.
scribe: We cannot hoard its light out of a misplaced respect for their isolation.
scribe: It is our sacred duty, inspired by the Avatar, to carry this light across the Cloud Sea.
scribe: We must share the unified truth, so no shard is ever left to endure the long night by themselves."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
